# Direct connect on the procedural UI system. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080. Title top-left like every screen, then one
# form panel centred on the shell map: player name, this machine's address, the remote address (an editable dropdown
# with the history), and Back / Host / Join on the panel's bottom row.
hide $Line

window $StaticWindowLabel left top 64 40 560 48 title
ruler left top 64 94 560

panel centre middle 0 -60 800 480
window $StaticPlayerNameDescription left top 584 268 500 24 meta
window $EditPlayerName left top 584 296 752 44 entry
window $StaticLocalIPDescription left top 584 364 500 24 meta
window $StaticLocalIP left top 584 392 752 32 caption
window $StaticRemoteIPDescription left top 584 448 500 24 meta
window $ComboboxRemoteIP left top 584 476 752 44 dropdown

window $ButtonBack left top 584 652 180 44 button
window $ButtonHost left top 916 652 200 44 button
window $ButtonJoin left top 1136 652 200 44 primary
